# Real exported mailbox data — LOCAL-ONLY, never committed.
# These .eml/.txt files contain real vendor/project PII (addresses, invoice and
# container numbers, etc.). Only the DERIVED digest is committed (digests/real/),
# not the raw source mail. Drop exported .eml/.txt here to enable the real-corpus
# path; on a fresh clone this dir is empty, so tests/test_email_digest.py::T7
# skips gracefully.
*
!.gitignore
